        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 505019LS26FA19, Two-Toned Faceted Lever with Modern Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Black and Silver Faceted Lever with Square Rose has a two-toned look that really makes it stand out. The square rosette and handle are both matte black, while the L-Square Stem is polished chrome for a retro-modern end look. The Two-Toned Faceted Lever with Modern Square Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit standard pre-drilled doors that are between 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSFA-specifications.gif?v=1704354648\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Faceted Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Matte Black and Polished Chrome Faceted Door Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Faceted L-Squared Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Stem Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Rose Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSFA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262372\"><b>Emtek Faceted Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Emtek Select Brass Lever is assembled to order—allowing the finishes to be custom designed. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirement or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Black and Silver Faceted Lever with Square Rose",
